Package: yamaa
Title: Clinical Data Specifications with the Shared 'Rust' Engine
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yilong", "Zhang", email = "elong0527@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ming-Chun", "Chen", role = "ctb"),
    person("Peng", "Zhang", role = "ctb"),
    person("Bingjun", "Wang", role = "ctb"),
    person("Jingwei", "Xiong", role = "ctb"),
    person("The authors of the bundled Rust crates", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "listed in inst/AUTHORS"),
    person("Evan Miller and the ReadStat authors", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "bundled ReadStat C sources, inst/LICENSE-READSTAT.txt"))
Description: Builds clinical data specifications, checks declarations, and
    renders submission metadata through the shared 'Rust' engine. Returns
    owned data frames of plain R values and structured diagnostics, with
    explicit publication of retained outputs. The specification language is
    documented at <https://elong0527.github.io/yamaa/>.
