Copyright: The yamaa contributors; for the bundled and linked third-party
    code and data, the holders that inst/AUTHORS lists and that
    inst/LICENSE-THIRD-PARTY.txt, inst/LICENSE-READSTAT.txt,
    inst/LICENSE-UNICODE.txt and inst/LICENSE-YAML.txt name.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: utils
Suggests: arrow (>= 23.0.1), jsonlite (>= 2.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager) (>= 1.82.0),
    rustc (>= 1.82.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
